# Navigation

File-based routing via Expo Router. `app/_layout.tsx` opens SQLite, runs migrations, and mounts providers.

- `app/(tabs)/` — Tables and Analytics
- `app/onboarding.tsx` — first launch. The baseline test creates the settings row
- `app/baseline.tsx` — maximum static hold, then a 4, 8, or 12 week CO2 plan
- `app/train.tsx` — live table. Slides in from the right and counts down each breathe-up, hold, and rest
- `app/settings/` — table configuration and purchases
- `app/paywall.tsx` — RevenueCat lifetime access
- `app/warning.tsx` — warning and confirmation sheet
